# Nothing is published unless it is listed here.
#
# Default-deny: every entry at the repository root is excluded, and the
# published files are re-included one by one below. Anything else that ends up
# in this working directory — drafts, working material, editor folders — stays
# out of the repository automatically, without having to be named.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CITATION.cff
!/files/

# OS and editor noise inside published folders
~$*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
